connected non-voter) and verify_outcome is event index 1 (same leader_id, operation VerifyLeader, voter_contact_count 1 from the leader itself, voter_quorum_met false, voter_confirmation_count 0, nonvoter_confirmation_count 1, result confirmed). The monitor's implication antecedent (voter_quorum_met false) and assertion (result not confirmed) evaluate false at index 1, producing a complete violating witness. The checker event, predicate fields, correlated prerequisite, and observed endpoint therefore correspond to the sourced obligation.\",\n        \"counterevidence\": [],\n        \"limitations\": [\n          \"The observation covers one three-voter/one-non-voter configuration shape and one in-memory transport schedule.\",\n          \"The harness declines the optional AppendEntriesPipeline fast path so every successful confirmation is observable through the documented fallback path.\",\n          \"The separate leader-lease timer is not part of the VerifyLeader completion endpoint observed here.\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"aspect\": \"applicability\",\n        \"status\": \"no_issue_found\",\n        \"source_ids\": [\n          \"src-api-verifyleader\",\n          \"src-suffrage\",\n          \"src-verifyleader\",\n          \"src-vote\",\n          \"src-notifyall\",\n          \"src-heartbeat\",\n          \"src-startstop\",\ntotal 36\ndrwxrwxr-x 3 nitro nitro  4096 Oct 10 13:57 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 4 nitro nitro  4096 Oct 10 13:57 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 nitro nitro 12202 Oct 10 13:57 accepted.json\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 nitro nitro  4096 Oct 10 13:57 inputs\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 nitro nitro 11537 Oct 10 13:57 raw.json\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
